Upstream RSMods
---------------
This project is a fork of RSMods (https://github.com/Lovrom8/RSMods) by Lovrom8 (Lovro),
ffio1 and contributors. RSMods is published without a licence. Its code remains
the property of its authors and is not covered by the MIT License above.

Rocksmith Audio Bridge is an independent extension of RSMods, maintained
separately. Please report problems at
https://github.com/Cheesewizard/RocksmithAudioBridge/issues, not to the RSMods authors.

